*Reflection*

*Most Challenging Part:* Data Preprocessing and Feature Engineering

*Why:*

1. Handling missing values and outliers
2. Identifying relevant features from complex clinical data
3. Ensuring data quality and consistency

*Improvement with More Time/Resources:*

1. *Data exploration and visualization*: In-depth analysis to understand data distributions and relationships
2. *Collaboration with clinicians*: Working closely with healthcare professionals to identify relevant features and validate findings
3. *Advanced feature engineering techniques*: Utilizing techniques like transfer learning, embeddings, or domain-specific feature extraction methods

